comments.body:
@participant1 of course, you're welcome. This all "unraveled" after you asked me to test Auth0 and then I started comparing headers :) 
That's a great idea, it could save a lot of pain in troubleshooting indeed, as this header becomes more mainstream. 
One thing I can add, is that after this I was wondering why GitLab instance was not suffering from the same problem, as it uses OIDC with the same IdP. And the reason is simple, the OIDC auth flow In GitLab only happens in the main window, there's no pop-up's involved. I don't know if that could be an option for Vault as well, thought I'd mention it. Cheers.
